 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Sure — Where are you from — originally? Before all this.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Nods slowly. \"Columbus, Ohio. I'll remember that. Everybody's from somewhere that isn't here.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Me? Columbus, Ohio. I still dream in its weather — rain on a tin roof, that specific smell. I wake up here and for a second I'm furious at the sky for the swap.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Still on where you're from.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up? That matters to me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Have you heard what they're calling Static? Cheyenne is pushing 'The Ugly Beast'. Everyone's got a name for it and nobody agrees.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They nod. \"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"I have opinions about the name. I am saving them for when they count.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Anyway — I should get going.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Are you going to stay? With us. For real. I mean it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Something eases in their shoulders. \"Good. We're better with you here. I mean that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"I stay where I'm useful. Right now that's here. Columbus, Ohio is a direction, not a plan. Here is a plan, even if it's a hard one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"...What's that supposed to mean?\" Their voice goes careful."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Still on whether you're staying.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Their eyes do the math before their mouth does. You can see the calculation happening."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"I wasn't a librarian. I was a mechanic. I was embarrassed. Everyone here was someone, and I was... that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Cheyenne looks at you, level. \"I told you the truth. You can keep poking it, but it's told.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"You're really going to make me say it again?\" Cheyenne rubs their face. \"Fine — but it's the same truth as last time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They fill the quiet. \"Anyway — where was I?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about what's been happening — we left it mid-thought, 4 days back. 'You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"The fire'll settle it. It settles everything, eventually.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"My vote? I'm keeping it to myself until the shouting stops.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "You show them American Ginseng — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Good — what's been happening, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"About that question — What's the worst thing you've done since the sky changed?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "No judgment in their face. \"We're all doing math that doesn't add up. You're still here. That counts.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "The warmth pulls back a notch. They're weighing something."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Here's what I think — Still on the worst thing you've done.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"The whole fire was arguing about mosquito last night — what to even CALL it. 'The Ugly Beast' got shouted down. What's your vote?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "You show them Wild Ginger — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"I'm staying out of the naming fight. For now. Someone always gets precious about their pick.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"...Actually, forget it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"I tried the American Ginseng like you showed me. Didn't poison anyone, so that's a win.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Still on that plant lesson.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"They took Priya — The Blood Tithe, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"That's... pretty much all of it, honestly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about what's been happening — we left it mid-thought, 7 days back. 'A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Come see what I found. You won't believe it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "On the way, Cheyenne stops and actually teaches you something — how they read a slope for water, how their grandmother did it. (Knowledge, freely given. The Codex notes it.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"We'll see what the treeline brings. We always do.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"I show up. That's my part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Alright. Catch you later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  }
 ],
